section CrPC CRPC Criminal Procedure Code Code of Criminal Procedure 411 CrPC section 411 The Code of Criminal Procedure, 1973 Making over or withdrawal of cases by Executive Magistrates Any District Magistrate or Sub- Divisional Magistrate may—
(a) make over, for disposal, any proceeding which has been started before him, to any Magistrate subordinate to him;
