(1) The State Government may, by notification in the Official Gazette, and subject to the condition of previous publication, make rules for the purposes of giving effect to the provisions of this Act.
(2) In particular, and without prejudice to the generality of the foregoing provisions, such rules may provide for- (a) the manner in which addition to the rent shall be made under sub-section (2) or clause (a) of sub-section (3) of section 11;
